[[File:AirTaxi.png|thumb|right|225px|An air taxi on [[Coruscant]]]]
'''Air taxis''' were a type of small, open-air [[Airspeeder|speeder]] used as passenger [[transport]]s on [[planet]]s with air traffic. The [[EasyRide passenger airspeeder|Coruscant air taxi]] saw use in great numbers on the world of [[Coruscant]],<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|coruscant-air-taxi|Coruscant Air Taxi}}</ref> where their [[pilot]]s transported customers around the planet.<ref name="AEYNTK">''[[Star Wars: Absolutely Everything You Need to Know]]''</ref> They utilized [[Airbus|air bus]] lanes to dart in and out of sky traffic.<ref name="SWCL">[[Star Wars: Complete Locations (2016)|''Star Wars: Complete Locations'']]</ref> They were also allowed to take shortcuts through the canyons of skyscrapers. Their max speed was 191kph (119mph).<ref name="AEYNTK" />

